# MF Overhaul 0.5.32: user on 0.5.31: vehicle dust very dark grey, almost black; "in mfo the dust was based on terrain".
#   Patch 3598/2 turned on terrain tinting of wheel / track dust (last column -1 -> 0.83 on dust_wh, 0.073 on the dirt rows):
#   the particle colour is now multiplied by the ground colour. Our realism colours (tan dust 168;156;126, dark-brown dirt
#   74;60;48) were absolute colours for the old untinted dust; multiplied by the ground they came out near black.
#   Back to the patch's neutral greys so the ground colour shows through; our size / gravity / spread tuning is kept.
#   The autumn dust_wh row (ours, not in vanilla) gets the patch's terrain columns as well.
